"Send Text File…" = "テキストファイルを送る…";
"Paste" = "ペースト";
"Send Example" = "例を送る";
"Load at (hexadecimal)" = "読み込み先(16 進)";
"Choose a raw binary, for example one built with Tools/assemble.sh. RAM is $0000-$7FFF." = "生のバイナリを選びます(例: Tools/assemble.sh で作ったもの)。RAM は $0000-$7FFF です。";
"Choose file…" = "ファイルを選ぶ…";
"Samples (included in the app)" = "サンプル(アプリに同梱)";
"Load Program" = "プログラムの読み込み";
